   3.9935146926876287`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"81d323df-af1a-4443-a240-\
20037384c9b5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "The 81 elastic constants cIsoFedorov[a, c, iklm] determined by ",
 StyleBox["a",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["c ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "according to Fedorov\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Eq (8.1). \n(a, c) \
\[LongRightArrow] VoigtMatrixOFc[cIsoFedorov[a, c, #] &] parameterizes all \
elastic maps, or rather their Voigt matrices.\nNothing to do with closest yet."
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993227256841578*^9, 3.993227315224392*^9}, {
  3.993242424872633*^9, 3.9932425053368073`*^9}, {3.9932425381662226`*^9, 
